{"seq":1,"slug":"on-device-vision","title":"端侧视觉：图像分类与目标检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/applications/on-device-vision","wordCount":1146,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"端侧视觉-图像分类与目标检测\">端侧视觉：图像分类与目标检测</h1><p>相机按下快门的瞬间，手机已经完成了场景识别、人脸检测、深度估计和曝光调节——这些视觉 AI 任务在用户察觉到快门声之前就已运行完毕，延迟预算通常不超过 30ms。端侧视觉是移动 ML 最早商业化、模型架构最成熟、NPU 加速支持最完善的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>端侧视觉任务按计算复杂度和输出形式可分为三个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入图像] --&gt; B{任务类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|整图级| C[图像分类&lt;br/&gt;单标签输出]&#10;    B --&gt;|区域级| D[目标检测&lt;br/&gt;边界框+类别]&#10;    B --&gt;|像素级| E[语义分割&lt;br/&gt;逐像素标签]&#10;    C --&gt; F[NPU 卷积密集&lt;br/&gt;延迟 3-10ms]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[NPU+GPU 混合&lt;br/&gt;延迟 15-50ms]\">graph TD\n    A[输入图像] --&gt; B{任务类型}\n    B --&gt;|整图级| C[图像分类&lt;br/&gt;单标签输出]\n    B --&gt;|区域级| D[目标检测&lt;br/&gt;边界框+类别]\n    B --&gt;|像素级| E[语义分割&lt;br/&gt;逐像素标签]\n    C --&gt; F[NPU 卷积密集&lt;br/&gt;延迟 3-10ms]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[NPU+GPU 混合&lt;br/&gt;延迟 15-50ms]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型模型</th>\n<th>端侧延迟 (2026 旗舰)</th>\n<th>模型大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图像分类</td>\n<td>单标签 + 置信度</td>\n<td>MobileNetV3/EfficientNet-Lite</td>\n<td>3-8ms</td>\n<td>5-20MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标检测</td>\n<td>N 个边界框 + 类别</td>\n<td>YOLOv8-nano/SSD-MobileNet</td>\n<td>8-20ms</td>\n<td>5-30MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义分割</td>\n<td>像素级掩码</td>\n<td>DeepLab-MobileNet/SegFormer-B0</td>\n<td>20-50ms</td>\n<td>10-40MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人体姿态</td>\n<td>关键点坐标</td>\n<td>MoveNet/BlazePose</td>\n<td>10-25ms</td>\n<td>3-10MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度估计</td>\n<td>深度图</td>\n<td>MiDaS-Small/Depth Anything-S</td>\n<td>15-40ms</td>\n<td>15-50MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"轻量化模型架构演进\">轻量化模型架构演进</h2><h3 id=\"mobilenet-系列\">MobileNet 系列</h3><p>MobileNet 开创了端侧高效卷积网络的范式——用深度可分离卷积（Depthwise Separable Convolution）替代标准卷积，将计算量降低 8-9 倍：</p>\n<p>标准卷积计算量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D_K^2 \\cdot M \\cdot N \\cdot D_F^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>深度可分离卷积：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(D_K^2 \\cdot M \\cdot D_F^2 + M \\cdot N \\cdot D_F^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0894em;vertical-align:-0.2753em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4247em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2753em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为卷积核大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 输入通道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 输出通道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 特征图大小。对于 3x3 卷积，理论加速比约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{N} + \\frac{1}{9} \\approx 8\\text{-}9\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>MobileNetV3（2019→持续优化至 2026）引入了 SE（Squeeze-and-Excitation）通道注意力和 h-swish 激活，在 ImageNet 上达到 75.2% Top-1 精度的同时保持 3-5ms 的端侧延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"efficientnet-lite\">EfficientNet-Lite</h3><p>EfficientNet 通过 NAS（Neural Architecture Search）在宽度、深度、分辨率三个维度上均匀缩放。Lite 版本去掉了对 NPU 不友好的 Swish 激活和 Squeeze-Excitation 模块（部分 ANE/NNAPI 实现对这些算子效率较低），换用 ReLU6。</p>\n<h3 id=\"vision-transformer-的端侧适配\">Vision Transformer 的端侧适配</h3><p>2026 年 ViT 已有多个端侧变体：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MobileViT-v2</strong>：混合 CNN-Transformer 架构，卷积提取局部特征 + 轻量 Attention 建模全局关系</li>\n<li><strong>EfficientViT</strong>：用线性注意力替代标准 Softmax Attention，计算复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>FastViT</strong>：通过结构重参数化在推理时将 Attention 融合为卷积</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"yolo-系列的端侧部署\">YOLO 系列的端侧部署</h2><p>YOLO（You Only Look Once）是目标检测领域的工程标杆。2026 年 YOLOv8/v9 的 nano 变体专为移动端设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>模型大小 (INT8)</th>\n<th>端侧延迟</th>\n<th>COCO mAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>YOLOv8n</td>\n<td>3.2M</td>\n<td>3.5MB</td>\n<td>8ms (ANE)</td>\n<td>37.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLOv8s</td>\n<td>11.2M</td>\n<td>12MB</td>\n<td>15ms (ANE)</td>\n<td>44.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLOv9-tiny</td>\n<td>2.0M</td>\n<td>2.3MB</td>\n<td>6ms (Hexagon)</td>\n<td>35.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLO-NAS-S</td>\n<td>12.6M</td>\n<td>13MB</td>\n<td>18ms (NNAPI)</td>\n<td>47.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"后处理-nms-与端侧实现\">后处理：NMS 与端侧实现</h3><p>YOLO 输出大量候选框（~8400 for YOLOv8），需要非极大值抑制（NMS）过滤。NMS 是纯 CPU 操作（条件分支密集），通常占整体推理时间的 10-20%。2026 年的优化方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>端侧 NMS 内置</strong>：Core ML 的 <code>NonMaximumSuppression</code> 层直接在模型中执行</li>\n<li><strong>Anchor-free 设计</strong>：YOLOv8 采用 anchor-free 头部，减少后处理计算</li>\n<li><strong>Top-K 前置过滤</strong>：在 NMS 前先按置信度排序取 Top-100，减少比较次数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实时视频流处理\">实时视频流处理</h2><h3 id=\"帧率与延迟预算\">帧率与延迟预算</h3><p>实时相机预览要求 30fps，即每帧预算 33ms。扣除相机采集（~5ms）和 UI 渲染（~8ms），留给 ML 推理的窗口约 20ms。</p>\n<h3 id=\"流水线设计\">流水线设计</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Camera&#10;    participant Preprocess&#10;    participant NPU&#10;    participant Postprocess&#10;    participant UI&#10;&#10;    Camera-&gt;&gt;Preprocess: Frame N (5ms)&#10;    Preprocess-&gt;&gt;NPU: 缩放+归一化 (2ms)&#10;    NPU-&gt;&gt;Postprocess: 推理 (10ms)&#10;    Postprocess-&gt;&gt;UI: NMS+绘制 (5ms)&#10;    Note over Camera,UI: 总延迟 22ms &lt; 33ms 预算&#10;    Camera-&gt;&gt;Preprocess: Frame N+1 (重叠执行)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Camera\n    participant Preprocess\n    participant NPU\n    participant Postprocess\n    participant UI\n\n    Camera-&gt;&gt;Preprocess: Frame N (5ms)\n    Preprocess-&gt;&gt;NPU: 缩放+归一化 (2ms)\n    NPU-&gt;&gt;Postprocess: 推理 (10ms)\n    Postprocess-&gt;&gt;UI: NMS+绘制 (5ms)\n    Note over Camera,UI: 总延迟 22ms &lt; 33ms 预算\n    Camera-&gt;&gt;Preprocess: Frame N+1 (重叠执行)</pre><p>关键优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>帧跳过</strong>：不需要每帧都推理，可以隔帧处理（30fps 相机只需 15fps 检测）</li>\n<li><strong>ROI 裁剪</strong>：只对感兴趣区域执行完整推理，背景区域用上一帧结果</li>\n<li><strong>模型级联</strong>：先用超轻量检测器定位，再对检测到的区域用精细模型分类</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"平台集成实践\">平台集成实践</h2><h3 id=\"ios-vision-core-ml\">iOS：Vision + Core ML</h3><p>Apple Vision 框架提供了预构建的视觉请求（VNRequest），底层自动使用 Core ML：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>VNClassifyImageRequest</code>：图像分类</li>\n<li><code>VNDetectFaceRectanglesRequest</code>：人脸检测</li>\n<li><code>VNGeneratePersonSegmentationRequest</code>：人像分割</li>\n<li><code>VNCoreMLRequest</code>：自定义 Core ML 模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"android-mlkit-camerax\">Android：MLKit + CameraX</h3><p>Google MLKit 提供即用型视觉 API，与 CameraX 的 ImageAnalysis 管线无缝集成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>人脸检测（含 468 个面部 landmark）</li>\n<li>物体检测与跟踪</li>\n<li>条码/文字识别</li>\n<li>姿态估计</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自定义模型则通过 TFLite <code>Interpreter</code> + Camera2/CameraX 帧回调集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>端侧视觉是 NPU 最擅长的场景：卷积密集、计算强度高、延迟要求严格</li>\n<li>MobileNet/EfficientNet-Lite 是分类基线，YOLOv8-nano 是检测基线</li>\n<li>实时视频流需要流水线设计：帧跳过 + ROI 裁剪 + 模型级联</li>\n<li>Vision (iOS) 和 MLKit (Android) 提供零配置的预置视觉能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"on-device-nlp-llm\">端侧自然语言与小型 LLM</a> — 从视觉到语言：NPU 工作负载从计算密集转向带宽密集</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ios-development/performance/rendering-performance\">iOS 性能优化：渲染性能</a> — 视觉 ML 推理结果叠加到相机预览的渲染优化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"端侧视觉：图像分类与目标检测","id":"端侧视觉-图像分类与目标检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"轻量化模型架构演进","id":"轻量化模型架构演进"},{"level":3,"text":"MobileNet 系列","id":"mobilenet-系列"},{"level":3,"text":"EfficientNet-Lite","id":"efficientnet-lite"},{"level":3,"text":"Vision Transformer 的端侧适配","id":"vision-transformer-的端侧适配"},{"level":2,"text":"YOLO 系列的端侧部署","id":"yolo-系列的端侧部署"},{"level":3,"text":"后处理：NMS 与端侧实现","id":"后处理-nms-与端侧实现"},{"level":2,"text":"实时视频流处理","id":"实时视频流处理"},{"level":3,"text":"帧率与延迟预算","id":"帧率与延迟预算"},{"level":3,"text":"流水线设计","id":"流水线设计"},{"level":2,"text":"平台集成实践","id":"平台集成实践"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS：Vision + Core ML","id":"ios-vision-core-ml"},{"level":3,"text":"Android：MLKit + CameraX","id":"android-mlkit-camerax"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"ONNX Runtime Mobile 与跨平台部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/frameworks/onnx-runtime-mobile"},"next":{"title":"端侧自然语言与小型 LLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-on-device-ml/applications/on-device-nlp-llm"}}